Z||000002||Cozmo||03-29-2001||09:55 AM||||He probably thinks the market is too small...<BR>A shame!  Guess we will have to live with what scales we have now.<BR>The three 1/25 scale kits available are actually quite realistic if built right...<BR>MPC 1-0715 (black) 1-0883 (red) Are good kits of an early style coupe, also comes with IMSA body parts. I think MPC made a silver one too.<BR>Monogram 2242 (red) Excellent mold of an Indy/'85 GT (notchback).<BR>MPC/Ertl 6401 '87/'88 GT (red) Fastback with optional IMSA body parts. I think made in black also.<BR>These kits aren't much smaller than 1/18 scale. I'd love to see a 1/18 diecast too but at least we have some good kits to work with already available...<BR><P>------------------<BR><B>C02M0</B><BR>[i]Suncoast Fieros[/]<BR>'85 2M6 Targa<BR>'86 GT<BR>'87 Coupe||||reg||9
